  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:400px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-darkblue pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Linguistic Assimilation</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/49/Starfire_Robin_kiss_1.gif/revision/latest?cb=20180807110628\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Starfire Robin kiss 1\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/49/Starfire_Robin_kiss_1.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20180807110628\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/49/Starfire_Robin_kiss_1.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20180807110628 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/49/Starfire_Robin_kiss_1.gif/revision/latest?cb=20180807110628 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Starfire Robin kiss 1\" width=\"270\" height=\"124\" data-image-key=\"Starfire_Robin_kiss_1.gif\" data-image-name=\"Starfire Robin kiss 1.gif\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">As a Tamaranean, Starfire (DC Comics/Teen Titans) is able to learn and master any language by making physical contact (i.e. kissing) with someone who already knows the language.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Learn any language through physical contact.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<div class=\"quote\">\n<dl><dd><i>\"Thank you. I am Koriand'r of Tamaran. Our kind can learn language from the act of kissing.\"<br />\"...Useful.\"</i></dd>\n<dd>― Starfire and Robin (Teen Titans: The Judas Contract)</dd></dl></div>\n<div class=\"quote\">\n<dl><dd><i>\"Hey! That galaxy's signaling in binary. I gotta signal back. But I only know enough binary to ask where the bathroom is. You speak English!?\"<br />\"I do now.\"</i></dd>\n<dd>― Bender and the Galactic Entity (Futurama)</dd></dl></div>\n<p>The ability to <b>learn any language through physical contact</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Biological_Absorption\" title=\"Biological Absorption\">Biological Absorption</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Omnilingualism\" title=\"Omnilingualism\">Omnilingualism</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLinguistic_Assimilation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Instant Language Learner</li>\n<li>Language Assimilation</li>\n<li>Omnilinguistic Assimilation</li>\n<li>Rosetta Stone</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLinguistic_Assimilation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user is capable of assimilating other languages through physical contact with another being. Upon physical contact, they would learn the language the target knows. Usually one or two, could be more if the target was multilingual.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLinguistic_Assimilation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Zoolingualism\" title=\"Zoolingualism\">Zoolingualism</a> (Upon physical contact with an animal)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Intuitive_Multilingualism\" title=\"Intuitive Multilingualism\">Multilingualism</a> (Probably)</li>\n<li>Learn almost any language quick and easy.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLinguistic_Assimilation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Learning\" title=\"Ability Learning\">Ability Learning</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Biological_Manipulation\" title=\"Biological Manipulation\">Biological Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/DNA_Replication\" title=\"DNA Replication\">DNA Replication</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Incantation\" title=\"Incantation\">Incantation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Knowledge_Replication\" title=\"Knowledge Replication\">Knowledge Replication</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Omnilingualism\" title=\"Omnilingualism\">Omnilingualism</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Replication\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Replication\">Power Replication</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Psychometry\" title=\"Psychometry\">Psychometry</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Vocifery\" title=\"Vocifery\">Vocifery</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Voice_Manipulation\" title=\"Voice Manipulation\">Voice Manipulation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLinguistic_Assimilation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May be temporary.</li>\n<li>May not work on animals or other races.</li>\n<li>May be able to learn one language at a time.</li>\n<li>May only able to work with a certain type of contact.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLinguistic_Assimilation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://archiesonic.fandom.com/wiki/Blodex\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:archiesonic:Blodex\">Blodex</a> (<i>Archie Comics' Sonic the Hedgehog</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dc.fandom.com/wiki/Tamaraneans\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dc:Tamaraneans\">Tamaraneans</a> (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Galactic Entity (<i>Futurama</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://masseffect.fandom.com/wiki/Prothean\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:masseffect:Prothean\">Protheans</a> (<i>Mass Effect</i>)\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://masseffect.fandom.com/wiki/Javik\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:masseffect:Javik\">Javik</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>Princess Kahm (<i>Outlanders</i>)</li>\n<li>PK (<i>PK</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLinguistic_Assimilation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class